dagger sinquidia~
This dagger is a longer version of a kriss.  It's blade wavers slightly less
then a kriss and is honed to a razor sharp edge.  Unlike a kriss it's almost
a sword in itself.  This particular sinquidia has back-notches to rend and
tear flesh as it's pulled from it's victim.
